:name: head_unit live wind
:description: head_unit (STM32H747I-DISCO) with its BLE radio (nRF52840 running Zephyr's hci_uart over HCI-UART) and the simulated wind sensor (nRF52840), on one BLE medium.
:
:Set $bin and $sdcard (head_unit, as for head_unit.resc), $hci_bin
:(build/hci_uart/zephyr/zephyr.elf) and $sensor_bin
:(build/sensor_sim/zephyr/zephyr.elf) -- see README.md.
:
:head_unit's CPU is held until the controller has had 1 s to set up its
:UART, as in Renode's own HCI-UART demo; call `power_on_head_unit` to
:release it.

emulation CreateUARTHub "hci"
emulation CreateBLEMedium "wireless"

# BLE needs frequent synchronisation between machines.
emulation SetGlobalQuantum "0.00001"

$name = "head_unit"
include $ORIGIN/head_unit.resc
connector Connect sysbus.uart8 hci
cpu IsHalted true

mach create "controller"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/boards/nrf52840dk_nrf52840.repl
connector Connect sysbus.radio wireless
connector Connect sysbus.uart1 hci
sysbus LoadELF $hci_bin

mach create "sensor"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/boards/nrf52840dk_nrf52840.repl
connector Connect sysbus.radio wireless
sysbus LoadELF $sensor_bin

macro power_on_head_unit
"""
    mach set "head_unit"
    cpu IsHalted false
"""
